5
00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:15.621
It was when Adam sang happy birthday to me.

6
00:00:15.621 --> 00:00:18.320
(gasping) I mean, hello.
I mean, I had chills,

7
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.810
chills, I couldn't believe it.
Hello, bucket list, check.

8
00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.400
Yeah.
Yeah, yes.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.040
That was, that was really special.

10
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:25.873
It was.

11
00:00:25.873 --> 00:00:28.020
Like we've all heard Happy Birthday, our entire lives.

12
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.910
He put a whole new spin on it

13
00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:32.410
But Adam Lambert, the best, the best.

14
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.500
Well, thank you, Ruby.
(audience applauding)

15
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.246
It was so much fun.
Thank you for having me,

16
00:00:35.246 --> 00:00:37.043
