(audience cheering)

21
00:00:50.113 --> 00:00:54.187
Oh my god!
(audience applauding)

22
00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.158
That is so cute, I love it!

23
00:00:56.158 --> 00:00:57.817
I can't believe it, oh my god!

24
00:00:57.817 --> 00:00:58.850
But much more importantly,

25
00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:00.420
